The neural network layers, replay buffer, target network updates, training
loop, and DeepMind Control Suite adapter include code adapted from Spectral-RL.

This version adds the FaStR state and action encoders, FaStR critics, and
optional exploration bonuses. It keeps only FaStR, uses one training entry
point, and updates the package layout, environment wrappers, and settings.

